          "source_text_sha256": "4b337aef459293e487fbd92084cc87873b7e2b36848073de1a9afb22a71f3180",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of three bright points moving together at very high altitude: observation of a triplet of Chinese satellites Yaogan-40 02.",
